<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's credit bank workers to renew strike.</title>
<headline>Morocco's credit bank workers to renew strike.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staff at state-owned farmers' credit bank Caisse Nationale du Credit Agricole (CNCA) will stage a one-day strike on Wednesday for pay increases and other benefits, a union spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;After our first strike on Jan 23, we had no serious proposal from the bank's management,&quot; a spokesman from the Democratic Labour Confederation said.</p>
<p>There are 3,400 employees in the bank's 250 branches.</p>
<p>Bank officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
